      "id": "why-stop",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 560,
      "y": 820,
      "width": 772.1999999999999,
      "height": 32.5,
      "text": "The split matters. A Colab box with somebody else's LLVM on PATH should go and fetch the right one,\nnot refuse to start. A person who set IRX_LLVM_BIN by hand should hear about it, not be ignored.",
